#: src/components/common/CheckInListList/index.tsx:49
msgid "<0>Check-in lists help you manage event entry by day, area, or ticket type. You can link tickets to specific lists such as VIP zones or Day 1 passes and share a secure check-in link with staff. No account is required. Check-in works on mobile, desktop, or tablet, using a device camera or HID USB scanner.                                </0>"
msgstr "<0>Orodha za kuingia hukusaidia kusimamia uingiaji wa tukio kwa siku, eneo, au aina ya tiketi. Unaweza kuunganisha tiketi kwenye orodha maalum kama maeneo ya VIP au vibali vya Siku ya 1 na kushiriki kiungo salama cha kuingia na wafanyakazi. Hakuna akaunti inayohitajika. Kuingia kunafanya kazi kwenye simu, kompyuta, au kompyuta kibao, ukitumia kamera ya kifaa au skana ya USB ya HID.                                </0>"

